  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">IWPR&apos;s &quot;Southern Balkans Crisis Information Project&quot;. Projektet &#xe4;r en informationsinsats p&#xe5; Balkan vilken syftar till att st&#xf6;dja lokala journalister i regionen, producera regionala analysrapporter, assistera internationell och regional media i nyhetsbevakning etc. Samarbetspart &#xe4;r Institute for War and Peace Reporting.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Southern Balkans Crisis Information Project, which objective is to support local journalists in the region, to produce regional analysis, assist international and regional media in news coverage and to increase the international and regional understanding of the conflict. The counterpart is Institute for War and Peace Reporting.</narrative>
  </description>
